OL,3,GNEWSAThe second life of a retired
OL,4,ADorset steam roller
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the very eastern edge of a historic
OL,7,Fmarket town sits a children's play
OL,8,Fpark, filled with swings, slides and a
OL,9,Fseesaw.
OL,11,FKing's Road Play Area in Dorchester,
OL,12,FDorset, is also uniquely home to one of
OL,13,Fa handful of decommissioned steam
OL,14,Frollers, placed in parks in the 1960s
OL,15,Fas play equipment.
OL,17,FDorchester Town Council's Carl Dallison
OL,18,Fsaid he thinks it could be the last one
OL,19,Fremaining in England being used in this
OL,20,Fway.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
