OL,3,GNEWSAThe second life of a retired
OL,4,ADorset steam roller
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They did about 16 apparently, all over
OL,7,Fthe place," he said. "We believe we've
OL,8,Fgot the only one left being used as a
OL,9,Fpiece of play kit."
